<i>Resident Evil</i> - but adapted to a retro 2D aesthetic from the 8 or 16-bit era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will struggle to survive while solving puzzles and fighting <strong>horrible</strong> creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet the secrets of the game lie within its <strong>cinematics...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you reach certain key points you will see sequences from a <strong>completely</strong> different point of view, made in live action with real actors and practical effects - created by a professional and award winning film crew from Argentina.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121510/extras/5fd5d86aebd202f0e6a984b06de439c0.poster.avif?t=1792175122\" width=616 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121510/extras/5fd5d86aebd202f0e6a984b06de439c0.webm?t=1792175122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121510/extras/5fd5d86aebd202f0e6a984b06de439c0.mp4?t=1792175122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4GHZ Dual Core Processor or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4GB of VRAM or greater<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 13 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.6 GHZ Quad Core Processor or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 8GB of VRAM or greater<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 13 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["Andrés Borghi","Saibot Studios"],"publishers":["New Blood Interactive"],"release_date":"Oct 16, 2026"}